{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56381","headline":"露赋附歌 · 张彦胜","name":"露赋附歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天降气兮地凝精，皇德茂兮芝盖平。\n金盘渍兮玉盃清，叶有露兮落有声。\n辽东之鹤中夜惊，日南之鸡淩晨鸣。\n华山栢兮多珠露，松子服之得长生。\n（见《文苑英华》卷十五）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张彦胜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56381.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56381","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}